Third-party content
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

data/telco_churn.csv
    IBM Telco Customer Churn sample dataset, published by IBM as sample data for
    IBM Cognos Analytics. Included here unmodified as a real-data cross-check.
    Source: https://github.com/IBM/telco-customer-churn-on-icp4d

All other data in this repository is synthetic, generated at run time by
churnrisk/churn_data.py and churnrisk/risk_data.py from fixed seeds. No personal
data is distributed with this project.

docs/article/
    The article this project accompanies, and its diagrams. Authored by the
    copyright holder and distributed here under the same Apache-2.0 licence as
    the code.

